description = "A jammed luggage locker behind the busker, Renner's key from the evidence photo working it loose. Inside: a burner drive and a note in a shaking hand — 'It's not Kanzaki. He's the hired hand. Follow the tender. R-9 is a CITY order. I have the seal number. If you're reading this, I didn't make it.' The courier had the whole shape of it before anyone. It got him killed."
